    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Soil and gravel testing can satisfy concerns about a site’s ability to accommodate a specific project.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following soil testing services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
